horizon zero dawn cements world is  filled with a bunch of creatures that  while beautiful in their own special way  will usually stop at nothing to kill you  fortunately our main girl a Lloyd has  the ability to override the beasts and  in some cases even mount them if you're  in the mood for hunting though you can  check out our gameplay video of the  craziest creatures in the game but if  all you want to do is tame these  magnificent beasts then climb aboard and  I'll show you how it's done first in  order to override a machine you'll need  to find a complete The Associated  dungeons known as cauldrons in the game  each cauldron has a huge network of  robotic caves and beating them will give  you the ability to override a specific  group of machines for example beating  cauldron Sigma grants access to the  sawtooth scrapper Grazer and Lance horn  once you snuck up on the machine and  convinced them to be on your team it  will happily fight alongside you  overridden machines will only be on your  side for a limited time but it's enough  to help you take down some of the  stronger enemies in the game fire up and  override on one of the behemoths and let  er rip surely nothing bad will come from  this  oh boy but if you're just sick and tired  of running around everywhere and when a  dedicated mount to halt your lazy butt  from place to place called rim psi is  the one you want and luckily the game is  pretty generous in providing you with  this because after completing one of the  main story missions early on in the game  a boy is given the override ability for  the first group of machines no dungeon  required there are three machines you'll  be able to tame and actually mount the  Strider the broadhead and the charger  just sneak up behind one of them hold  triangle to channel the override and  congratulations you are now the proud  owner of a mechanical deer good mileage  nice handling while a LOI will be able  to travel faster with the mount  she actually won't 